@* Upload state is the caller's to know, so it is a parameter rather than something the component
   guesses. Every row carries the control that state implies — and the failed one carries two,
   because "try again" and "give up" are different answers.

   The title shimmers while a file is uploading or processing. That is a real utility now: the
   class was on AttachmentTitle from the start and the utility was never defined, so an uploading
   file looked exactly like a finished one. *@
<div class="flex w-full max-w-sm flex-col gap-2">
    <Attachment State="idle" Class="w-full">
        <AttachmentMedia><Icon Name="clock" /></AttachmentMedia>
        <AttachmentContent>
            <AttachmentTitle>selected-file.pdf</AttachmentTitle>
            <AttachmentDescription>Ready to upload</AttachmentDescription>
        </AttachmentContent>
        <AttachmentActions>
            <AttachmentAction AriaLabel="Remove selected-file.pdf"><Icon Name="x" /></AttachmentAction>
        </AttachmentActions>
    </Attachment>

    <Attachment State="uploading" Class="w-full">
        <AttachmentMedia><Spinner /></AttachmentMedia>
        <AttachmentContent>
            <AttachmentTitle>design-system.zip</AttachmentTitle>
            <AttachmentDescription>Uploading · 64%</AttachmentDescription>
        </AttachmentContent>
        <AttachmentActions>
            <AttachmentAction AriaLabel="Cancel upload"><Icon Name="x" /></AttachmentAction>
        </AttachmentActions>
    </Attachment>

    <Attachment State="processing" Class="w-full">
        <AttachmentMedia><Icon Name="file-text" /></AttachmentMedia>
        <AttachmentContent>
            <AttachmentTitle>market-research.pdf</AttachmentTitle>
            <AttachmentDescription>Processing document</AttachmentDescription>
        </AttachmentContent>
        <AttachmentActions>
            <AttachmentAction AriaLabel="Remove market-research.pdf"><Icon Name="x" /></AttachmentAction>
        </AttachmentActions>
    </Attachment>

    <Attachment State="error" Class="w-full">
        <AttachmentMedia><Icon Name="file-warning" /></AttachmentMedia>
        <AttachmentContent>
            <AttachmentTitle>financial-model.xlsx</AttachmentTitle>
            <AttachmentDescription>Upload failed. Try again.</AttachmentDescription>
        </AttachmentContent>
        <AttachmentActions>
            <AttachmentAction AriaLabel="Retry upload"><Icon Name="refresh-cw" /></AttachmentAction>
            <AttachmentAction AriaLabel="Remove financial-model.xlsx"><Icon Name="x" /></AttachmentAction>
        </AttachmentActions>
    </Attachment>

    <Attachment State="done" Class="w-full">
        <AttachmentMedia><Icon Name="check" /></AttachmentMedia>
        <AttachmentContent>
            <AttachmentTitle>uploaded-report.pdf</AttachmentTitle>
            <AttachmentDescription>Uploaded · 1.8 MB</AttachmentDescription>
        </AttachmentContent>
        <AttachmentActions>
            <AttachmentAction AriaLabel="Remove uploaded-report.pdf"><Icon Name="x" /></AttachmentAction>
        </AttachmentActions>
    </Attachment>
</div>
